## Final Judgement
The key insight from the fact-check is that the video clip in question was not unedited; it was an abbreviated version of Joe Biden's full response from a debate, omitting part of his statement. Twitter applied warnings based on its synthetic and manipulated media policy to specific tweets (from Dan Scavino and Donald Trump's retweet) that contained this edited clip. Biden's campaign later clarified his position, indicating the clip was misleading. Thus, the claim that Twitter placed warnings on "just unedited clips" is false because the clips were edited.

